#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<PER_LINUX_FDPIC> (since Linux 2.6.11)"
msgstr "B<PER_LINUX_FDPIC> (seit Linux 2.6.11)"

#. type: Plain text
