"SCO OpenServer 5.  Implies B<STICKY_TIMEOUTS> and B<WHOLE_SECONDS>; "
"otherwise no effect."
msgstr ""
"SCO OpenServer 5. Impliziert B<STICKY_TIMEOUTS> und B<WHOLE_SECONDS>; "
"ansonsten kein Effekt."

